{'symbol': 'PH', 'date': '2021-04-20 17:00:00', 'title': 'PARKER TO ANNOUNCE FISCAL 2021 THIRD QUARTER EARNINGS ON APRIL 29TH; CONFERENCE CALL AND WEBCAST SCHEDULED FOR 11 A.M. EASTERN', 'text': "CLEVELAND, APRIL 20, 2021 (GLOBE NEWSWIRE) -- PARKER HANNIFIN CORPORATION (NYSE: PH), THE GLOBAL LEADER IN MOTION AND CONTROL TECHNOLOGIES, TODAY ANNOUNCED THAT IT WILL RELEASE ITS FISCAL 2021 THIRD QUARTER EARNINGS BEFORE THE MARKET OPENS ON THURSDAY, APRIL 29, 2021, FOLLOWED BY A CONFERENCE CALL AT 11:00 A.M., EASTERN TIME.\xa0 DURING THE CALL, THE COMPANY WILL DISCUSS FISCAL 2021 THIRD QUARTER RESULTS AND RESPOND TO QUESTIONS FROM INSTITUTIONAL INVESTORS AND SECURITY ANALYSTS. \xa0THE CONFERENCE CALL WILL BE WEBCAST SIMULTANEOUSLY ON PARKER'S INVESTOR WEBSITE AT WWW.PHSTOCK.COM WITH AN ACCOMPANYING SLIDE PRESENTATION. THE WEBCAST WILL BE ARCHIVED ON THE SITE FOR ONE YEAR AND AVAILABLE FOR REPLAY LATER THAT DAY."}